<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/this-week-in-billboard-chart-history-in-1992-madonna-at-1-with-this-used-to-be-my-playground/20150807">This Week in Billboard Chart History: In 1992, Madonna at #1 with &#8216;This Used to Be My Playground&#8217;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
