		<title>Madonna is the only female artist to hit the top of the UK chart with 2 songs on the same week!</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-is-the-only-female-artist-to-hit-the-top-of-the-uk-chart-with-2-songs-on-the-same-week/20150803</link>
		<comments>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-is-the-only-female-artist-to-hit-the-top-of-the-uk-chart-with-2-songs-on-the-same-week/20150803#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2015 18:17:39 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Dexter]]></dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[chart fact]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Holiday]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Into the Groove]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Official Charts Company]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=5847</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>On this day (August 3, 1985), 30 years ago, Madonna hit the UK Singles Chart with Into The Groove and [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-is-the-only-female-artist-to-hit-the-top-of-the-uk-chart-with-2-songs-on-the-same-week/20150803">Madonna is the only female artist to hit the top of the UK chart with 2 songs on the same week!</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>On this day (August 3, 1985), <strong>30 years ago</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> hit the UK Singles Chart with <strong>Into The Groove</strong> and she was at #2 with <strong>Holiday</strong>! No one like her, <strong>Madonna is the only female artist ever to hit the top 2 positions of the UK chart with 2 songs on the same week</strong>!</p>
<p>With sales of <strong>871,300</strong> units, <strong>Into The Groove</strong> is tied with Vogue for her longest stint at Number 1 – four weeks.</p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/52iW3lcpK5M?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p>As we said above, Into The Groove also managed to keep Madonna herself off Number 1, with <strong>Holiday</strong> that sat at #2 right behind Into The Groove at the top of the Official Singles Chart (sales of <strong>709,400</strong> units).</p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/5Rswx2Z7SDw?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p>Read more: <a href="http://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/madonna-s-official-top-40-biggest-selling-singles__8266/" target="_blank">OfficialCharts</a></p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-is-the-only-female-artist-to-hit-the-top-of-the-uk-chart-with-2-songs-on-the-same-week/20150803">Madonna is the only female artist to hit the top of the UK chart with 2 songs on the same week!</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
